 Introductie 
Are you someone who likes to keep an overview, values quality, and is not afraid to roll up your sleeves? We are looking for an Operational Support Specialist to strengthen our Warehouse team. 
In this versatile role, you will support the Warehouse Team Leader in coordinating and monitoring daily operational processes. You will also work hands-on in the operation, helping ensure that activities are carried out safely, efficiently, and on time. 
 Wie zoeken we? 
MBO-level working and thinking ability (vocational education level); 
Knowledge of warehouse products, services, and operational processes; 
Basic knowledge of automated Warehouse Management Systems (WMS); 
Basic knowledge of Microsoft Excel and Word; 
Strong communication and interpersonal skills; 
A proactive and motivating attitude; 
The ability to set priorities and perform well under time pressure; 
Good command of Dutch and/or English. For French-speaking locations, proficiency in French and/or English is required; 
At least 6 months of relevant experience as a Warehouse Operator and/or VAS Operator. 
A completed vocational qualification is preferred.
